* Fri Jan 23 2026 Xingrui Yi <yixingrui@linux.alibaba.com> [5.10.134-19.3_rc2%%DIST%%]
- xfrm: fix rcu lock in xfrm_notify_userpolicy() (Nicolas Dichtel)
- bpf: Improve check_raw_mode_ok test for MEM_UNINIT-tagged types (Daniel Borkmann) {CVE-2024-49861}
